{"version":1,"key":"card:769","content":{"id":769,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们通过 "},{"type":"content-link","refId":177,"contentId":171,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"context.drawImage","code":true}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将图片绘制到 canvas 上时，如果绘制的尺寸和实际的图片尺寸不同，就会产生缩放，此时可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"context.imageSmoothingEnabled","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来控制是否需要对图片进行平滑处理。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"imageSmoothingEnabled","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一个布尔值，默认是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"true","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示会对图片进行平滑处理，进行平滑处理后，缩放后的图片看起来会更加的柔和，比较适合照片、插图等场景。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"const canvas = document.querySelector(\"canvas\");\nconst ctx = canvas.getContext(\"2d\");\n\nctx.imageSmoothingEnabled = true;\nctx.drawImage(img, 0, 0, 300, 300);","uuid":"e712f2dc-adda-4f02-a42a-204acbab7223","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但有些场景，却不能进行平滑处理，比如我们的图片是像素风，如果对其进行平滑处理，反而会变得模糊，这个时候我们就需要手动将这个值设置为 false，以此来保持清晰的像素块效果"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"ctx.imageSmoothingEnabled = false;\nctx.drawImage(pixelImage, 0, 0, 160, 160);","uuid":"061e6b90-0cd6-400b-9269-f5e9df644ed0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还有一个相关字段 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"imageSmoothingQuality","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它是来控制平滑质量的，有三个可选值，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"low","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"medium","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"high","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它的默认值是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，该值仅在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"imageSmoothingEnabled","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"true","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 才有效果，另外该值只是一个提示，不同的浏览器和设备实际使用的插值算法和效果可能有所不同。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","code":"const ctx = canvas.getContext(\"2d\");\n\nconsole.log(ctx.imageSmoothingQuality); // \"low\"\n\nctx.imageSmoothingEnabled = true;\nctx.imageSmoothingQuality = \"high\";\n\nctx.drawImage(img, 0, 0, 500, 500);","uuid":"3a7e403b-ca23-437c-9bf6-79a9add05049","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Canvas/imageSmoothingEnabled","Canvas/imageSmoothingQuality"],"createTime":1782653682357,"updateTime":1782654432853,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1782654432853},"links":{"card:177":{"key":"card:177","type":"card","id":177}}}